Subject: [PATCH 4/5] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...hip.Box where Value is Swift is is Sendable & ~Copyable.swift} | 0
 ...yable.swift => Ownership.Unique where Value is Copyable.swift} | 0
 ....Unique where Value is ~Copyable & Swift is is Sendable.swift} | 0
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Ownership/{Ownership.Box+Swift.Sendable.swift => Ownership.Box where Value is Swift is is Sendable & ~Copyable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Ownership/{Ownership.Unique+Copyable.swift => Ownership.Unique where Value is Copyable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Ownership/{Ownership.Unique+Swift.Sendable.swift => Ownership.Unique where Value is ~Copyable & Swift is is Sendable.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Ownership/Ownership.Box+Swift.Sendable.swift b/Sources/Ownership/Ownership.Box where Value is Swift is is Sendable & ~Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Ownership/Ownership.Box+Swift.Sendable.swift
rename to Sources/Ownership/Ownership.Box where Value is Swift is is Sendable & ~Copyable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Ownership/Ownership.Unique+Copyable.swift b/Sources/Ownership/Ownership.Unique where Value is Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Ownership/Ownership.Unique+Copyable.swift
rename to Sources/Ownership/Ownership.Unique where Value is Copyable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Ownership/Ownership.Unique+Swift.Sendable.swift b/Sources/Ownership/Ownership.Unique where Value is ~Copyable & Swift is is Sendable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Ownership/Ownership.Unique+Swift.Sendable.swift
rename to Sources/Ownership/Ownership.Unique where Value is ~Copyable & Swift is is Sendable.swift
